                    coach_r1_engagement:    `<strong>That's the diagnosis the research supports.</strong> Disengagement — not a shortage of ideas — is why well-funded innovation programs stall. A team that fell from 78 to 41 stopped delivering; fix the engagement and the slippage and the unheard ideas start to move with it.`,
